This archive contains the hashes and detached GPG signatures for Pirate Paper Wallet.

Verify the hashes by running:
sha256sum -c sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt

Verify signatures:
1. First, import the public key (Available on GitHub
   as public_key.asc in this repository)
gpg --import public_key.asc

2. Verify signature
gpg --verify <filename.sig> <downloaded-filename-to-verify>

The checksum manifest is also signed:
gpg --verify sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt.sig sha256sum-vX.Y.Z.txt
